# direnv: enter this flake's devShell on `cd` into the directory, and leave it
# again on the way out. nix-direnv caches the evaluated shell and keeps a gcroot
# for it, so only the first entry is slow and `nix store gc` won't undo it.
#
# Once per clone, because direnv refuses to run a file it has not been shown:
#   direnv allow
use flake
